Placeholder.

 ba'e      BAhE     emphasize next
                    forethought emphasis indicator; indicates next word
                    is especially emphasized



 za'e      BAhE     nonce-word next
                    forethought nonce-word indicator; indicates next
                    word is nonce-creation and may be nonstandard



 zei       ZEI      lujvo glue
                    joins preceding and following words into a lujvo



 xi        XI       subscript
                    subscript; attaches a numer of letteral string
                    following as a subscript onto grammar structures
